RevivedHack is an adaptation of PC Hack 3.61 (in turn a port of UNIX
Hack 1.0.3) to modern operating systems. This version is the first to
support graphical tiles, among a number of other changes (detailed in
the included "Changes.txt" file). The saved game format has changed,
so if you've got an existing saved game hold onto the version that
created it so you can complete your game. There are a few more things
I have in mind for this game, so a new version is forthcoming once I
finish migrating to a new PC.

